<article class=\"card stack gap-sm project\" data-tags=\"mobile research\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\">Transit app redesign</h3>\n          <div class=\"row center gap-sm\">\n            <span class=\"badge\">mobile</span>\n            <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">research</span>\n            <span class=\"muted small\">2026</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"small muted\">Lead designer · Ljubljana Public Transport</div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\" style=\"margin:0\">Cut trip-planning taps from 7 to 3 for 400k riders.</p>\n        <div class=\"alert\">\n          <strong>Outcome:</strong> App store rating rose from 3.4 to 4.6 in six months. That is a <span class=\"up\">+1.2</span> rating gain, plus 4 fewer taps per trip planned — roughly 1.6M fewer taps a day across the rider base.\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm project\" data-tags=\"web service design\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin:0\">Clinic booking system</h3>\n          <div class=\"row center gap-sm\">\n            <span class=\"badge\">web</span>\n            <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">service design</span>\n            <span class=\"muted small\">2025</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"small muted\">Product designer · Zdravje Clinics</div>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\" style=\"margin:0\">Self-serve booking that halved front-desk calls.</p>\n        <div class=\"alert\">\n          <strong>Outcome:</strong> 58% fewer booking calls; 91% of patients book online. Fewer than 1 in 10 patients still need the phone to get an appointment.\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"row between small\" style=\"margin-bottom:4px\">\n            <span class=\"muted\">Patients booking online</span>\n            <strong>91%</strong>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"progress\"><div 